<title>USA: Alpine Lace Q4 shr $0.06 vs $0.14.</title>
<headline>Alpine Lace Q4 shr $0.06 vs $0.14.</headline>
<dateline>MAPLEWOOD, N.J. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.06		    $0.14</p>
<p> Net		 351			782</p>
<p> Revs		38,662		   41,358</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  5,210		    5,345</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.31		    $0.74</p>
<p> Net		 1,902		    4,016</p>
<p> Revs		161,897		  145,043</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  5,239		    5,289</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full year and Q4 1995 results reflect an income tax benefit due to prior years' tax loss carryforwards.  On a pro forma basis, applying a 38 percent tax rate, quarterly earnings would have been $472,000, or $0.08 a share. On the same basis, earnings for all of 1995, before extraordinary items, would have been $2.7 million, or $0.49 a share.</p>
